      "section": "功能介绍",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/doccenter-submission/agc-help-publish-api-app-submit-0000002271160585#section41670133",
      "text": "此接口用于提交HarmonyOS应用/元服务审核，调用本接口前必须保证应用信息已补充完整，应用软件包已经上传。"
    },
